{"unit_id":"QIFANAI__dsh-startup-elisa#card-zh","repo":"QIFANAI/dsh-startup-elisa","commit":"cc3c7e4f51dc62f70f1b0c5c51731719197cb51f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-startup-elisa 是面向 DSH 网页端的启动动画与客户端皮肤插件。它通过 Host 侧接入 DSH webServer，在启动页面插入冷启动层，并向设置页注册「ELISA 启动动画」面板。主要功能包括按会话或每日显示启动 HUD、交接转场与音效、四档皮肤和三套玻璃主题，以及速度、音量、动效和通透度设置。适合希望定制 DSH 启动体验和界面的用户；无需 API 密钥，配置保存在本机 DSH 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-5","lib/index.js:18-27","lib/index.js:300-390","lib/client.js:1444-1455"]}
{"unit_id":"QIFANAI__dsh-startup-elisa#card-en","repo":"QIFANAI/dsh-startup-elisa","commit":"cc3c7e4f51dc62f70f1b0c5c51731719197cb51f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-startup-elisa adds a startup HUD and visual skins to DSH web clients. It serves local animation assets and adds a settings panel for startup frequency, speed, audio, four skin modes, and glass themes. No API key is needed; settings stay in the local DSH directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-5","lib/index.js:300-390","lib/client.js:1444-1455"]}
