{"unit_id":"QIFANAI__dsh-startup-elisa#feature-1","repo":"QIFANAI/dsh-startup-elisa","commit":"cc3c7e4f51dc62f70f1b0c5c51731719197cb51f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-startup-elisa 的功能「启动 HUD」：Host 首屏注入动画根节点，浏览器端按配置呈现启动 HUD，并提供跳过、 reduced motion 和启动频率控制。 通过设置页控制相关选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:350-390"]}
{"unit_id":"QIFANAI__dsh-startup-elisa#feature-2","repo":"QIFANAI/dsh-startup-elisa","commit":"cc3c7e4f51dc62f70f1b0c5c51731719197cb51f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-startup-elisa 的功能「音效与同步」：启动层调用音频引擎播放主音轨和提示音，并按动画时间同步；自动播放受限或资源失败时可继续静音。 通过设置页控制相关选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/audio.js:169-212"]}
{"unit_id":"QIFANAI__dsh-startup-elisa#feature-3","repo":"QIFANAI/dsh-startup-elisa","commit":"cc3c7e4f51dc62f70f1b0c5c51731719197cb51f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-startup-elisa 的功能「皮肤和主题」：客户端设置面板提供 off、accent、full、glass 档位，并可选择玻璃主题及调节动态效果和通透度。 通过设置页控制相关选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1210-1265"]}
{"unit_id":"QIFANAI__dsh-startup-elisa#feature-4","repo":"QIFANAI/dsh-startup-elisa","commit":"cc3c7e4f51dc62f70f1b0c5c51731719197cb51f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-startup-elisa 的功能「配置面板」：DSH 设置页注册 ELISA 面板，用户可调整启动方式、速度、声音与外观设置并预览。 通过设置页控制相关选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1124-1265"]}
